      "content": "it's just... hard to keep pretending there's a tomorrow when today feels like a punishment. i'm so tired of the noise, the shame, the constant feeling of being watched and judged. if the book is actually closed like you're saying, does it even matter if i stay? or would it be better if i just made the ending match the reality everyone sees?",
